I'm Onur, and I run [DTP Services Berlin](https://dtp-services.de): multilingual layout and accessible PDFs, from Arabic to Japanese, InDesign to PDF/UA.

This journal is where I write down what happens on real jobs. The file that looked fine and wasn't. The checker that said pass. The fix that took ten minutes after a day of looking. Client names stay out; the know-how stays in.

